  "releaseNotes": "Initial release.\n\n\t\t  • Interactive Template Engine Playground for ASP.NET Core MVC (.NET 8)\n\t\t  • Test Razor and Mustache templates with JSON model input\n\t\t  • Generate HtmlContent, HtmlRaw, EncodedHtml (Base64), and PDF output\n\t\t  • Configurable route registration and custom route support\n\t\t  • Self-contained Razor views and static web assets\n\t\t  • IronPdf integration for PDF generation\n\t\t  • Requires a valid IronPdf license key for File (PDF) output",
